      "description": "Press Release ISVA Product Pricing About Blog Contact Resources Careers Documentation FAQs EULA PRIVACY POLICY DEPLOYMENT Press Release Schedule demo Rapydo Joins AWS ISV Accelerate Program The A WS ISV Accelerate Program is a co-sell initiative for AWS Partners who offer software solutions running on or integrating with AWS. The program facilitates new business opportunities and accelerates sales cycles by connecting ISVs with the AWS Sales organization. Benefits include prioritized access to millions of active AWS customers and collaboration with AWS field sellers globally, ensuring better customer outcomes and mutual commitment. Rapydo Expands Cloud Database Optimization with AWS Designations Rapydo provides a powerful, user-friendly platform for monitoring and optimizing MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. Managing databases can be complex, with performance bottlenecks, scalability challenges, and operational inefficiencies slowing down businesses. Rapydo eliminates these roadblocks by offering real-time monitoring, actionable insights, and performance tuning recommendations, enabling businesses to maintain high availability and efficiency in their database infrastructure.Our platform is built to adapt to the unique needs of any organization, whether managing a single database instance or orchestrating multiple clusters across different environments. We prioritize flexibility over one-size-fits-all solutions, allowing database administrators (DBAs) and development teams to customize their monitoring, set tailored alerts, and optimize their databases based on specific workloads and requirements. Transparency is at the core of Rapydo's approach. Instead of reactive troubleshooting, we empower teams with proactive insights, ensuring they stay ahead of potential issues. Our intuitive interface provides clear visibility into database performance, allowing users to pinpoint inefficiencies, improve query execution, and optimize resource allocation with minimal effort. Key Features of Rapydo : ‍ Performance Optimization – Identify slow queries, inefficient indexing, and resource bottlenecks, with actionable recommendations to enhance performance. ‍ Scalability – Support both horizontal and vertical scaling, making it easy to expand infrastructure without downtime. ‍ Custom Alerts & Notifications – Configure alerts tailored to your environment to detect anomalies before they become critical issues. ‍ Seamless Integration – Easily deploy and integrate Rapydo with existing MySQL and PostgreSQL database environments, with minimal setup required. By simplifying database management, Rapydo allows businesses to focus on innovation rather than maintenance. Whether you're a startup looking to optimize costs or an enterprise managing mission-critical workloads, our platform ensures that your MySQL and PostgreSQL databases perform at their best. Trax , a leading AI and computer vision company for the physical retail sector, needed a solution to manage unpredictable database performance across hundreds of clients. With each client operating under different Service Level Agreements (SLAs) and usage patterns, ensuring consistent performance was a constant challenge. Scaling databases in response to performance issues led to soaring costs, without addressing the root of the problem. Cashify , India’s leading platform for buying and recycling used smartphones, is at the forefront of the tech-powered circular economy. Scout by Rapydo is the perfect partner for scaling a fast-growing platform like Cashify. Its proactive monitoring and optimization tools have not only improved our database performance but also empowered our teams to focus on innovation rather than firefighting. We’re excited to continue working with Scout as we grow. Rapydo , a leading provider of MySQL and PostgreSQL database monitoring and optimization solutions, announces its latest advancements in collaboration with Amazon Web Services (AWS). As part of this initiative, Rapydo has achieved key AWS designations, reinforcing its commitment to delivering scalable, high-performance database management solutions in the cloud. By earning the AWS ISV Accelerate certification , Rapydo has demonstrated deep technical expertise and proven customer success in helping businesses optimize and scale their cloud-based databases efficiently. This recognition underscores Rapydo's ability to support organizations in reducing database operational complexity, improving performance, and ensuring high availability on AWS infrastructure. Additionally, Rapydo has been recognized as an AWS Service Delivery Partner , validating its expertise in deploying and managing AWS-native database solutions such as Amazon RDS and Amazon CloudWatch. This designation highlights Rapydo's ability to provide seamless integration, real-time monitoring, and proactive performance optimization for AWS customers. “Our collaboration with AWS aligns with our mission to simplify database management for businesses of all sizes,” said Matan Nataf, Co-Founder and CEO at Rapydo . “These AWS designations reflect our commitment to delivering best-in-class solutions that enable customers to maximize database efficiency and scalability while minimizing operational overhead. ”With these achievements, Rapydo continues to strengthen its cloud-first approach, helping organizations accelerate innovation by leveraging AWS’s secure, scalable, and fully managed database services. Contact Us: info@rapydo.io © Rapydo 2024 All rights reserved Home Product Pricing About Blog Schedule Demo Contact FAQs Careers Try Now",
